# @mayamemo/mcp

MayaMemo MCP server — durable project memory, checkpoints and handoffs for coding agents, over stdio.

## Use with opencode (zero install)

```json
{
  "mcp": {
    "mayamemo": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": ["npx", "-y", "@mayamemo/mcp"],
      "environment": {
        "MAYAMEMO_API_URL": "https://api.mayamemo.com",
        "MAYAMEMO_TOKEN": "mm_sk_..."
      },
      "enabled": true
    }
  }
}
```

Any MCP-capable host works the same way: `npx -y @mayamemo/mcp` with
`MAYAMEMO_API_URL` + `MAYAMEMO_TOKEN` in the environment.

Get a key at https://mayamemo.com → Account settings → Developers.

Tools: `memory_save`, `memory_search`, `context_search`, `context_get`,
`project_state`, `checkpoint_create`, `checkpoint_resume`, `entity_observe`,
`graph_query`, `attachment_upload`, `attachment_describe`, `memory_feedback`,
`session_start`, `session_end`.
